@startuml UC-33
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-33.md
title UC-33: Apply Voucher
footer Feature CHK-02 | Business rules: BR-24, BR-25, BR-26, BR-27
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "CheckoutController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "CheckoutService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Enter voucher code and click Apply
MVC -> API : POST /api/checkout/voucher { code }
API -> SVC : PreviewWithVoucherAsync(currentUserId, code)
SVC -> DB : Load selected cart lines -> subtotal
SVC -> DB : Find voucher by Code
alt voucher not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Invalid voucher code"
else found
  SVC -> SVC : Check eligibility (BR-26):\nIsActive, StartAt <= now <= EndAt,\nsubtotal >= MinOrderAmount,\nUsageLimit IS NULL OR UsedCount < UsageLimit
  alt not eligible
    SVC --> API : BadRequest (reason)
    API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
    MVC --> U : Show reason (inactive, not started, expired,\nbelow minimum, usage limit reached)
  else eligible
    SVC -> SVC : Discount (BR-27), Total (BR-24)
    SVC --> API : CheckoutTotalsDto
    API --> MVC : 200 OK
    MVC --> U : Show discount and new total
  end
end
opt customer removes the voucher
  U -> MVC : Click "Remove voucher"
  MVC -> API : GET /api/checkout
  API --> MVC : 200 OK (totals without discount)
  MVC --> U : Show total without discount
end
note over SVC : The voucher is checked again\nwhen the order is placed (BR-30)

@enduml
